---
layout: base.njk
title: 首页
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>欢迎来到我的博客</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">分享思考、知识与经验</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-primary">了解更多</a>
      <a href="/archive/" class="btn btn-secondary">浏览文章</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="featured-posts">
  <h2 class="section-title">最新文章</h2>
  
  <div class="posts-grid">
    {% for post in collections.post | reverse %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <div class="post-card-content">
          <div class="post-meta">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateToISO }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
            {% if post.data.tags %}
              <span class="post-tags">
                {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
                  {% if tag != "post" %}
                  <a href="/tags/{{ tag }}/" class="tag">#{{ tag }}</a>
                  {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
              </span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="post-title">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
          </h3>
          
          {% if post.data.description %}
            <div class="post-excerpt">
              <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
          
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="read-more">阅读全文 &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-content">
    <h2>想了解更多？</h2>
    <p>欢迎查看我的所有文章或关注我的社交媒体</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/archive/" class="btn btn-primary">文章归档</a>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-secondary">关于我</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
